  "name": "Chicken Carbonara with Peas",
  "subtitle": "Creamy spaghetti with chicken, bacon, Parmesan, and peas",
  "description": "A savory pasta dinner combining browned chicken and bacon with wine, Parmesan, eggs, and tender peas.",
